WEBVTT

00:07:58.994 --> 00:08:05.606
and the symbol was also featured
on cigar labels, boxtops, road signs

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.535
and even poker chips.

00:08:07.559 --> 00:08:12.915
Even the Jain made use of the logo
along with a hand of God

00:08:12.939 --> 00:08:14.737
many millennia ago.

00:08:15.372 --> 00:08:17.540
These marks were identical,

00:08:17.564 --> 00:08:19.740
but with use as a Nazi symbol,

00:08:19.764 --> 00:08:22.711
the impact became very, very different.

00:08:23.322 --> 00:08:25.290
The hand of God,

00:08:25.314 --> 00:08:27.320
the Nike swoosh

00:08:27.344 --> 00:08:29.265
and the swastika:

00:08:29.289 --> 00:08:34.967
they all demonstrate how we've been
manufacturing meaning with visual language